### 1. Registrar parcela; copiar id de la respuesta en @parcelId
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/parcels
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"  <b>Huerto Norte</b>  ","location":{"latitude":28.63,"longitude":-106.08},"soilType":"LIMOSO","ownerOrLead":"Edwin Ledezma"}

### 2. Listar
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/parcels

### 3. Sustituir UUID
@parcelId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/parcels/{{parcelId}}

### 4. Registrar lectura con alerta de humedad baja
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/readings
Content-Type: application/json

{"parcelId":"{{parcelId}}","soilMoisture":10,"temperature":25,"ph":6.5,"nitrogen":40,"phosphorus":20,"potassium":100,"airQuality":50,"measuredAt":"2026-01-01T12:00:00Z"}

### 5. Consultar estado
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/readings/parcels/{{parcelId}}/current

### 6. Validación: respuesta 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/parcels
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"","location":{"latitude":100,"longitude":-106.08},"soilType":"LIMOSO","ownerOrLead":""}

### 7. UUID inválido: respuesta 400
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/parcels/invalido

### 8. Parcela inexistente: respuesta 404
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/parcels/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
